   ('36-my-sin-shall-not-hinder-his-goodness-working-a-deed-shall', 'XXXVI', 'My sin shall not hinder His Goodness working.... A deed shall be done, as we come to Heaven, and it may be known here in part; though it be truly taken for the general Man, yet it excludeth not the special. For what our good Lord will do by His poor creatures, it is now unknown to me', ('CHAPTER XXXVI', '"My sin shall not hinder His Goodness working.... A deed shall be\n done--as we come to Heaven--and it may be known here in part;--though\n    it be truly taken for the general Man, yet it excludeth not the\n special. For what our good Lord will do by His poor creatures, it is\n                          now unknown to me"'), 'Our Lord God shewed that a deed shall be', '[5] See v., xlviii., lix., lxi.'),
