   ('56-god-is-nearer-to-us-than-our-own-soul-we-can-never-come-t', 'LVI', 'God is nearer to us than our own soul" "We can never come to full knowing of God till we know first clearly our own Soul', ('CHAPTER LVI', '"God is nearer to us than our own soul" "We can never come to full\n        knowing of God till we know first clearly our own Soul"'), 'And thus I saw full surely that it is', 'here, where it means "the Substance."'),
